ege Station is expected to bring more than 3,000 jobs while raising new questions about infrastructure, incentives and rural growth."]}'::jsonb,'/images/news/generated/2026-08-08-musk-terafab-grimes-county-texas.svg','/images/news/generated/2026-08-08-musk-terafab-grimes-county-texas.svg','Musk Companies Confirm $16.8 Billion Terafab Semiconductor Project in Grimes County editorial illustration')
